<title>NEW ZEALAND: Official segment indicators from NZ wool sales.</title>
<headline>Official segment indicators from NZ wool sales.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The official market indicator from Thursday's wool sales at Napier and Dunedin was 456 NZ cents per kg clean, Wools of New Zealand said.</p>
<p>Official segment indicators, as published by Wools of New Zealand (in cents per kg clean) were:</p>
<p>    Fine     18/24 micron - 805</p>
<p>    Medium   25/31 micron - 502</p>
<p>    Strong   32/41 micron - 417</p>
<p>    Lambs		     - 397</p>
<p>-- Wellington Newsroom (64 4) 4734746</p>
